        "description": {
          "text": "Added a single IV dose fosaprepitant 150 mg regimen (with 5HT3 antagonist and corticosteroid) for prevention of acute and delayed nausea/vomiting with highly emetogenic chemotherapy",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This \"Prior Approval\" supplemental new drug application proposes a new dosing regimen for the use of a single intravenous dose of fosaprepitant 150 mg, dosed concomitantly with a 5HT3 receptor antagonist and corticosteroid, for the prevention of acute and delayed nausea and vomiting associated with initial and repeat courses of highly emetogenic cancer chemotherapy.",
